    "question": "যদি $a + b + c = 0$ হয়, প্রমাণ করুন যে, $a^3 + b^3 + c^3 = 3abc$",
    "steps": [
      "দেওয়া আছে, $a + b + c = 0$",
      "বা, $a + b = -c$",
      "বা, $(a+b)^3 = -c^3$",
      "বা, $a^3 + b^3 + 3ab(a+b) = -c^3$",
      "বা, $a^3 + b^3 - 3abc = -c^3$ $[\\because a + b = -c]$",
      "বা, $a^3 + b^3 + c^3 = 3abc$"
    ],
    "answer": "$a^3 + b^3 + c^3 = 3abc$ (প্রমাণিত)"
